                    UDP SCAN

Scanner                         Target
   |                               |
   |-------- UDP Probe ----------->|
   |                               |
   |                               |
   |<---- ICMP Port Unreachable ---|
   |                               |
   ▼
Likely CLOSED


Scanner                         Target
   |                               |
   |-------- UDP Probe ----------->|
   |                               |
   |           NO RESPONSE         |
   |<..............................|
   |
   ▼
OPEN or FILTERED


UDP has no TCP-style handshake,
so interpretation can be ambiguous.
